  "proWelcomeTitle": "You are on Pro",
  "proWelcomeBody": "Every feature is unlocked. There is nothing else to set up.",
  "proWelcomeAction": "Start using it",
  "featSearch": "Search inside your screenshots",
  "featSearchBody": "Find any screenshot by the words written in it, in Arabic or English. Nothing is uploaded — the reading happens on your phone.",
  "featSafeShare": "Safe share",
  "featSafeShareBody": "Swaps card numbers, addresses, names and contact details for realistic stand-ins — same length, same format, same place. The copy you send does not look edited.",
  "featActions": "Turn screenshots into actions",
  "featActionsBody": "Call a number, open a link, copy a verification code or an IBAN — straight from the picture, without retyping anything.",
  "featDuplicates": "Find duplicates",
  "featDuplicatesBody": "Spot near-identical shots you kept twice and clear them out — always with a review step first.",
  "featStitch": "Merge long screenshots",
  "featStitchBody": "Join a scrolling capture back into one tall image, with the overlap found and removed automatically.",
  "featUnlimited": "Unlimited folders and screenshots",
  "featUnlimitedBody": "The free tier stops at a few folders and screenshots. Pro removes both caps.",
  "featSearchHow": "SHOTO reads the text printed inside every screenshot and remembers it, so one word you remember seeing is enough to find the picture again — no file names, no folders, no scrolling.",
  "featSearchPoint1": "Reads Arabic and English, and still matches when the spelling differs slightly.",
  "featSearchPoint2": "Also finds by what the picture shows — try \"receipt\", \"cat\" or \"food\".",
  "featSearchPoint3": "The reading happens on your phone. Nothing is uploaded, so it works offline too.",
  "featSafeShareHow": "Finding what is private in a screenshot is free and unlimited. Paying is what turns those findings into a clean copy: each detail is redrawn in the screenshot's own colours as a different, equally ordinary value.",
  "featSafeSharePoint1": "Card numbers are Luhn-checked and IBANs mod-97 checked — and the stand-ins pass the same checks, so nothing looks fabricated.",
  "featSafeSharePoint2": "Also catches names, addresses, order numbers, verification codes, phone numbers and email addresses.",
  "featSafeSharePoint3": "You see every change before you send, and can cover or keep any of them instead. The original screenshot is never touched.",
  "featActionsHow": "Whatever is written inside a screenshot becomes something you can use. SHOTO picks out the useful parts and puts a button on each one.",
  "featActionsPoint1": "Phone numbers, links, email addresses, IBANs and verification codes are found for you.",
  "featActionsPoint2": "One tap to call, open or copy — no reading digits off a picture.",
  "featActionsPoint3": "Works on the screenshots you already have, not only on new ones.",
  "featStitchHow": "Take a few shots as you scroll through a long chat or page, and SHOTO works out where they overlap and joins them back into one tall image.",
  "featStitchPoint1": "The repeated strip between two shots is found and removed automatically.",
  "featStitchPoint2": "You see the join before anything is saved — automatic detection is good, but never certain.",
  "featStitchPoint3": "The merged image saves to your gallery like any other picture.",
  "featDuplicatesHow": "SHOTO compares screenshots by what they look like rather than by name or size, so it catches the near-identical ones too — a resend, a different crop, the same thing captured twice.",
  "featDuplicatesPoint1": "Groups whatever looks the same and suggests the copy worth keeping.",
  "featDuplicatesPoint2": "Shows how much space each group frees before you decide anything.",
  "featDuplicatesPoint3": "Nothing is deleted until you have reviewed the group and confirmed it.",
  "featUnlimitedHow": "The free tier is a real, usable app rather than a trial — it just has a ceiling. Pro takes the ceiling off, and everything you already organized stays exactly where it is.",
  "featUnlimitedPoint1": "As many folders as your library actually needs.",
  "featUnlimitedPoint2": "No cap on how many screenshots you file and favourite.",
  "featUnlimitedPoint3": "Saving, folders, favourites and search history stay yours either way.",
